Kingdom of Heaven is a 2005 epic historical drama film directed and
produced by Ridley Scott and written by William Monahan.

11
01:23:22,105 --> 01:23:28,105
It features an ensemble cast including Orlando Bloom, Eva Green, Jeremy Irons,
David Thewlis, Brendan Gleeson, Marton Csokas, and Liam Neeson.

12
01:30:56,842 --> 01:31:02,842
The film is a portrayal of the events leading to the Third Crusade, focusing mainly on Balian of Ibelin
who fights to defend the Crusader Kingdom of Jerusalem from the Ayyubid Sultan Saladin.

13
